cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use d-raft in published work, please cite this software."
title: "d-raft: Deterministic semantic artifacts for Raft"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-17"
authors:
  - given-names: Mohammadamin
    family-names: Khanbabaei
    alias: aminkbi
    website: "https://github.com/aminkbi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
repository-artifact: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft/releases/tag/v0.1.0"
url: "https://github.com/aminkbi/d-raft"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  d-raft is a deterministic research platform for producing replayable,
  minimized, and independently checkable Raft executions. It combines a pure
  durable reference model, semantic decision tapes, structured safety
  witnesses, bounded systematic exploration, a production-core etcd/raft
  adapter, and capability-negotiated cross-implementation evidence.
keywords:
  - Raft
  - consensus
  - distributed systems
  - deterministic simulation
  - fault injection
  - reproducibility
